  <EditorialHero eyebrow="OUR STORY" description="We believe the loveliest spaces are thoughtful, comfortable, and personal—not perfect." photo="about">Here's to a home<br/><em>that feels like you.</em></EditorialHero>
  <div class="shell info-page"><h2>The little details make the difference.</h2><p>The Soft Nest Edit is an independent home decor journal and discovery site for anyone who wants to create a more inviting home, one thoughtful decision at a time.</p><p>Our Journal shares original styling guidance for small spaces, bedrooms, living rooms, and everyday routines. In Shop the Edit, we highlight items that appear useful for those ideas, explain what catches our attention, and encourage you to check the current listing details before purchasing.</p><div class="manifesto"><h2>What guides our recommendations</h2><p>We aim to be transparent about affiliate relationships, offer original context, avoid unsupported quality claims, and remove recommendations when their information can no longer be verified. A curated pick is not the same as a personally tested review.</p></div><p>Purchases are completed directly with Amazon or the relevant retailer. We do not operate a shopping cart, collect payment details, or fulfill physical orders.</p><a class="button" href="/journal/">Explore the Journal ↗</a></div>
</Base>
